<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115188" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώννῡμι</span></b> , later form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόω,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Arr.
			<u>An.</u>
			2.18.3
		</span></i>, etc.; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωννύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Plb.
			1.47.3
		</span></i>: impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχώννυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					14.49
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 3pl.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχώννυσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					66.4
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώννυσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.40.4
				</span></i>
			, etc.; subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωννύηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					5.486.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχωννύμεθα</span>
			<i>we were covered with a heap of earth,</i> i. e. <i>had a
				sepulchral mound raised over us</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόω</span> fin.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.136
			</span></i> (Antip.), <i><span class="en">
				137
			</span></i>.</div>
